{"id":"e06t2","name":"Daily Checkout Funnel","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","events_df"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>The product team follows a checkout funnel with three steps: <code>view</code>, then <code>cart</code>, then <code>purchase</code>. <code>events_df</code> has the columns <code>user_id</code> (string), <code>event</code> (string) and <code>event_at</code> (timestamp). Event names must be trimmed and lower-cased; other events are ignored.</p>\n<p>The funnel is computed <b>per user and per calendar day</b> of <code>event_at</code>:</p>\n<ul><li>a user <b>viewed</b> on a day if they have at least one <code>view</code> that day;</li><li>a user <b>carted</b> if they have a <code>cart</code> event <b>after</b> (or at the same time as) their first <code>view</code> of the day;</li><li>a user <b>purchased</b> if they have a <code>purchase</code> event after (or at the same time as) their first <code>cart</code> that counts for <i>carted</i>.</li></ul>\n<p>Events of a step that happen before the previous step do not count. Your task is to return, for every day with at least one viewer, the columns <code>day</code> (date), <code>viewed</code>, <code>carted</code>, <code>purchased</code> (long, numbers of distinct users) and <code>conversion_pct</code> (double, <code>100 * purchased / viewed</code> rounded to 1 decimal), sorted by <code>day</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p><code>events_df</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>user_id</th><th>event</th><th>event_at</th></tr><tr><td>u1</td><td>view</td><td>2026-03-01 10:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>u1</td><td>cart</td><td>2026-03-01 10:05:00</td></tr><tr><td>u1</td><td>purchase</td><td>2026-03-01 10:06:00</td></tr><tr><td>u2</td><td>cart</td><td>2026-03-01 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>u2</td><td> VIEW</td><td>2026-03-01 09:30:00</td></tr><tr><td>u2</td><td>purchase</td><td>2026-03-01 09:40:00</td></tr><tr><td>u3</td><td>view</td><td>2026-03-01 12:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>u3</td><td>view</td><td>2026-03-01 12:01:00</td></tr><tr><td>u4</td><td>purchase</td><td>2026-03-01 08:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>u1</td><td>view</td><td>2026-03-02 08:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>u1</td><td>cart</td><td>2026-03-02 08:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>u1</td><td>purchase</td><td>2026-03-02 08:00:00</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>day</th><th>viewed</th><th>carted</th><th>purchased</th><th>conversion_pct</th></tr><tr><td>2026-03-01</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>33.3</td></tr><tr><td>2026-03-02</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>100.0</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, events_df: DataFrame) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return events_df\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["entonnoir","ordre des étapes","min par étape","comptage distinct"],"minutes":20,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"events_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"user_id string, event string, event_at timestamp","rows":[["u1","view","2026-03-01 10:00:00"],["u1","cart","2026-03-01 10:05:00"],["u1","purchase","2026-03-01 10:06:00"],["u2","cart","2026-03-01 09:00:00"],["u2"," VIEW","2026-03-01 09:30:00"],["u2","purchase","2026-03-01 09:40:00"],["u3","view","2026-03-01 12:00:00"],["u3","view","2026-03-01 12:01:00"],["u4","purchase","2026-03-01 08:00:00"],["u1","view","2026-03-02 08:00:00"],["u1","cart","2026-03-02 08:00:00"],["u1","purchase","2026-03-02 08:00:00"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["day","viewed","carted","purchased","conversion_pct"],"rows":[["2026-03-01",3,1,1,33.3],["2026-03-02",1,1,1,100.0]]}},{"input":{"events_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"user_id string, event string, event_at timestamp","rows":[["a","view","2026-03-05 23:59:00"],["a","cart","2026-03-06 00:01:00"],["b","view","2026-03-05 10:00:00"],["b","cart","2026-03-05 11:00:00"],["b","purchase","2026-03-05 10:30:00"],["b","cart","2026-03-05 10:10:00"],["b","search","2026-03-05 10:00:00"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["day","viewed","carted","purchased","conversion_pct"],"rows":[["2026-03-05",2,1,1,50.0]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}